<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Brazil's Light started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Brazil's Light started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said on Thursday it had started coverage of Light Servicos de Eletricidade SA of Brazil with a rating of outperform.</p>
<p>-- The stock closed at 324 in Sao Paulo on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Wall Street Desk (212) 859-1730</p>
</text>
